MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"QD48BhLk7lDTgOL_NiVCCw","review_id":"-BsXOl6kGjdiO-gpoZBFpw","date":"2019-11-03T14:36:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9417694211006165,"text_excerpt":"This place is by far one of the best Mexican restaurants in the city I've been to. Per the review before mine, it is Americanized Mexican, but I can promise you you're not going to find real Mexican food anywhere in NOLA. I got the chicken enchilada and chicken taco a la charge, plus their pico and queso fresco. The chicken seemed to be higher quality grilled chicken rather than just cheap shredded chicken. The queso was pretty tasty and so was the pico! Not puréed salsa but rather the whole pieces of tomato, yum. I will definitely be back!"},{"business_id":"QD48BhLk7lDTgOL_NiVCCw","review_id":"QMryad0EDN7ZzqLXVUE26w","date":"2012-04-09T22:54:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9396050572395325,"text_excerpt":"My favorite place for real Mexican tacos. I could eat here once a week but I am good and stay away. Love love love that they have re-fried black beans instead of those pinto beans every other place has. I love fish, chicken, shrimp, american and cheese tacos. The taco salad and the Mexican pizzas are awesome too, Don't forget the cebollitas, chips and pico and guacamole. The margaritas are pretty good too. Sometimes they like to rush you out if they are busy, but nobody says you have to leave, just keep ordering more margaritas!"},{"business_id":"QD48BhLk7lDTgOL_NiVCCw","review_id":"UUwk8an4FaAJrR_tCMwerg","date":"2013-07-08T17:04:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9389117360115051,"text_excerpt":"This is our favorite Mexican establishment in the greater New Orleans area. The shining star of it all? The fish tacos! I recommend you order at least one fish taco during your visit & be sure to ask for the sauce caddy making a tour through the restaurant because the black sauce (sorry, no clue what this sauce is exactly) makes a tasty fish taco that much more tastier! Other excellent tacos include the steak & the shrimp. They have many other varieties (tongue anyone? None for me, thanks!) sure to interest anyone in your party. If you're needed a cheesy cheese fix, I highly recommend the cheese enchilada. It's true...parking is a pain. Lucky for us, we live in the area and walk 100% of t..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"QD48BhLk7lDTgOL_NiVCCw","photo_id":"C4aJfANGaMPbdR1Ud_iUdQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/C4aJfANGaMPbdR1Ud_iUdQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8980259895324707},{"business_id":"QD48BhLk7lDTgOL_NiVCCw","photo_id":"LAuSPduNc_2AWuOP5z0BRw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LAuSPduNc_2AWuOP5z0BRw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8769961595535278},{"business_id":"QD48BhLk7lDTgOL_NiVCCw","photo_id":"7HAqwdyHumTQvAWMKvmhgg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/7HAqwdyHumTQvAWMKvmhgg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8515697717666626}]},"notebook_case":null}
